==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Wall Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*15 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore Jr.]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Henry]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**20 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Anti-Wave units are recommended here to deal with Bore Jr. [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Supercat]] is recommended to burn on this stage to save more potent options for later in the run. Using [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]] here is also recommended as Cadaver Bearcat is replaceable by [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]] in the only stage it's worth using in.

==Trivia==
*This is the only Underground Labyrinth stage that features [[Ms. Sign]].

